		"these.",
		"Serbian counts in three: 1 варијанта, 2 варијанте, 5 варијанти.",
		"The Latin catalogue (sr-YU) is transliterated from this one by tools/serbian-latin.mjs.",
		"Serbian is digraphic and the two scripts map one to one, so the Latin is the same text in",
		"the other alphabet rather than a second translation. The fallback rules keep them apart",
		"deliberately: neither may borrow from the other, since a reader asked for one alphabet.",
		"Formal address (ви), matching the tone of the HikaShop backend."
